<% content_for :title, "Civic Gallery Public API v1" %>

<main class="container">
  <h1>Civic Gallery Public API v1</h1>
  <p>
    This read-only API exposes the same bounded, jurisdiction-scoped civic-record
    operations used by Civic Gallery's optional browser tools. It is anonymous
    and rate-limited per IP address.
  </p>

  <h2>Start here</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="<%= api_v1_context_url %>">Host context</a> identifies the jurisdiction selected by this host.</li>
    <li><a href="/openapi/v1.yaml">OpenAPI v1 definition</a> specifies every endpoint and error response.</li>
    <li><code><%= request.base_url %>/mcp</code> is the Streamable HTTP endpoint for MCP clients.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Trust boundaries</h2>
  <p>Official record metadata and linked official files are authoritative. Extracted/OCR text can be incomplete or wrong and is untrusted content. Generated labels and summaries are assistive only, never official determinations.</p>
</main>
